<Placemark><name>Pizza House</name><styleUrl>#pin</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[I think I may have eaten more meals at this place than any other restaurant.<br><br>618 Church St]]></description><Point><coordinates>-83.73479,42.27419,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Frita Batidos</name><styleUrl>#pin</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[A place that didn't exist when I was here, but I feel like for a version of me 20 years younger, this would be high on my list.<br><br>117 W Washington St]]></description><Point><coordinates>-83.74936,42.28041,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Blimpy Burger</name><styleUrl>#pin</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[A spot that Will should eat at that you should not.<br><br>304 S Ashley St]]></description><Point><coordinates>-83.75012,42.27941,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Fleetwood Diner</name><styleUrl>#pin</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Tiny diner. No chance of getting in there on game day, but maybe try it another day.<br><br>300 S Ashley St]]></description><Point><coordinates>-83.75005,42.27951,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Brown Jug</name><styleUrl>#pin</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[If Will went here and was 21, he'd have some hazy memories of this spot.<br><br>1204 S University Ave]]></description><Point><coordinates>-83.73432,42.27489,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Good Time Charley&#x27;s</name><styleUrl>#pin</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[I think the last fight I was in in my life was at Good Time Charley's. See if maybe you guys can start one here on your visit.<br><br>1140 S University Ave]]></description><Point><coordinates>-83.73485,42.27482,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Mr. Spot&#x27;s</name><styleUrl>#pin</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Will should eat here. You should not.<br><br>808 S State St]]></description><Point><coordinates>-83.74077,42.27161,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Dominick&#x27;s</name><styleUrl>#pin</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Great place to drink when it's warm out. I can't recall when it closes for the season, so it may be closed when you're there.<br><br>812 Monroe St]]></description><Point><coordinates>-83.73871,42.27315,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>3 · Zingerman&#x27;s Deli</name><styleUrl>#pin</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[The classic Ann Arbor deli. If College GameDay is ever in Ann Arbor, you'll see a shot of Zingerman's.<br><br>422 Detroit St]]></description><Point><coordinates>-83.74515,42.2847,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
